								text: "A rule of faith and an image of meekness, and like the garden in the middle of paradise thou enlightenest the world by thy righteous deeds, and therefore we lovingly venerate thine honoured bier and faithfully cry out: intercede for those who hymn your light-bearing memory, O Father Jonah, and pray that our souls may be saved.",
								type: "1",
