								kind: "kontakion",
								text: "Thou didst accept from on high divine grace to intercede between God and men, as a bishop raising up offerings and bringing down peace and an abundance of fruits to thy people, O blessed Jonah, for thou art the praise of Great Novgorod and the joy of those who dwell therein.",
								type: "1",
